WEBVTT

00:08:29.329 --> 00:08:33.246
A lot of the skills I use as a CEO
today, running my company,

00:08:33.287 --> 00:08:36.746
these are things I learned
before I was five.

00:08:36.787 --> 00:08:38.912
These are the moments and experiences

00:08:38.954 --> 00:08:41.787
that make us who we are and make us human.

00:08:41.787 --> 00:08:44.871
And I can't think of anything
more important than that.

00:08:44.912 --> 00:08:46.037
Thank you.

00:08:46.079 --> 00:08:49.079
(Applause)